Design two classes: Book and Library.

Book:

Fields: title (String), author (String), ISBN (String). All are immutable after creation.

Provide a constructor and getters for each field.

Override equals and hashCode based on ISBN (since ISBN is unique).

Library:

Maintains a collection of Book objects.

Provides addBook(Book book) to add a book. If a book with the same ISBN already exists, do not add it again (or throw an exception—your choice, but document it).

Provides removeBook(String isbn) to remove a book by ISBN.

Provides findByTitle(String title) that returns a list of books with the given title (case-insensitive). If none, return an empty list.


The internal collection must be completely hidden from outside code.

